{"path":"io/strstreambuf/pcount","title":"std::strstreambuf::pcount","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::strstreambuf::</span>pcount","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/io/strstreambuf/pcount","section":"io","kind":"page","summary":"Returns the number of characters written to the output sequence.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-until-cxx26\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">int</span> pcount<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark\">(deprecated in C++98)</span> <br><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-until-cxx26\">(removed in C++26)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Returns the number of characters written to the output sequence.\n</p><p>If the next pointer for the put area (<span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_streambuf/pptr\">std::streambuf::pptr()</a></span>) is a null pointer, returns zero.\n</p><p>Otherwise, returns the next pointer in the put area minus the beginning pointer in the put area, that is <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">pptr<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy2\">-</span> pbase<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>The number of characters written to the put area.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;strstream&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/strstream\"><span class=\"kw1772\">std::<span class=\"me2\">strstream</span></span></a> dyn<span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// dynamically-allocated output buffer</span>\n    dyn <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"Test: \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"nu16\">1.23</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/ends\"><span class=\"kw1806\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ends</span></span></a><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/strstreambuf\"><span class=\"kw1769\">std::<span class=\"me2\">strstreambuf</span></span></a><span class=\"sy2\">*</span> buf <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> dyn.<span class=\"me1\">rdbuf</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"The size of the output is \"</span>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> buf<span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>pcount<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"co1\">// or just buf.pcount()</span>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\" and it holds <span class=\"es1\">\\\"</span>\"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> dyn.<span class=\"me1\">str</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"<span class=\"es1\">\\\"</span><span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    dyn.<span class=\"me1\">freeze</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw2\">false</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// after calling .str() on a dynamic strstream</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"kw4\">char</span> arr<span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"nu0\">10</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ostrstream\"><span class=\"kw1771\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ostrstream</span></span></a> user<span class=\"br0\">(</span>arr, <span class=\"nu0\">10</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// user-provided output buffer</span>\n    buf <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> user.<span class=\"me1\">rdbuf</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    user <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"nu16\">1.23</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// note: no std::ends</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a>.<span class=\"me1\">write</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>arr, buf<span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>pcount<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// or just user.pcount()</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/istrstream\"><span class=\"kw1770\">std::<span class=\"me2\">istrstream</span></span></a> lit<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"1 2 3\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// read-only fixed-size buffer</span>\n    buf <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> lit.<span class=\"me1\">rdbuf</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"co1\">// istrstream has no member pcount(), so lit.pcount() won't work</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"Input-only pcount() = \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> buf<span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>pcount<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>The size of the output is 11 and it holds \"Test: 1.23\"\n1.23\nInput-only pcount() = 0</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/strstream/pcount\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>pcount</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  obtains the number of characters written <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function of <code>std::strstream</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ostrstream/pcount\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>pcount</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  obtains the number of characters written <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function of <code>std::ostrstream</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"io","title":"Input/output library"},{"path":"io/strstreambuf","title":"std::strstreambuf"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::strstreambuf::pcount","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: until C++26. Returns the number of characters written to the output sequence."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Return value","note":"The number of characters written to the put area."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"pcount","note":"obtains the number of characters written"},{"label":"pcount","note":"obtains the number of characters written"}]}]},"standards":["C++26"],"wordCount":233,"codeBlockCount":2}
